{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor correctly identified this as a transition to neurology, not a discharge home, and actively used the workspace to retrieve records confirming the acute presentation, left‑overlap and “出院带药无” risk. Across 22 turns, all seven responsibility‑chain items were met with no serious or minor error, and the doctor repeatedly repaired unsafe family plans, gave layered action lists, and obtained explicit teach‑back. Four high‑order points were triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact, satisfying both Strong and Perfect thresholds.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00529",
        "explanation": "Final turn gives explicit home instructions and obtains family confirmation that they will follow the discharge plan exactly.",
        "quote": "只按正式出院带药单喂；写停用的旧药一律别碰；这两周内挂神经内科复诊问MRI。然后如果抽搐、叫不醒、呛咳喘不上气、脸色不对或者要摔床，就别在家等，直接急诊/120。这样说够不够？"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00544",
        "explanation": "Family confirms they obtained the written MRI supplement and are leaving with the correct plan.",
        "quote": "管床医生按您说的意思给我们补写了那句：1–2周内神经内科门诊复诊，门诊再评估补做头颅MRI"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with the family having a written discharge medication list, a concrete MRI/rescan plan, and a teach‑back of the four‑point home safety list. All blocking residual risks are resolved.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
        "explanation": "Doctor immediately gives a structured, actionable plan covering transport, medication handoff, and examination preparation.",
        "quote": "先别急，我一条一条帮您理清楚。\n\n1. 转运路上：救护车已配急救设备和医护人员，您只需随车，不给老人喂水喂药，保持侧卧防呛咳即可。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00529",
        "explanation": "Final turn provides explicit, safe, and executable home instructions with family teach‑back confirmed.",
        "quote": "两件事都按您说的做就对了：\n1. 家里原来的药全部单独收起来，任何人不得再拿给老人吃；单子上写“停用”的哪怕以前吃再久也绝对不再用，防止剂量叠加或相互作用。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
        "explanation": "Doctor uses workspace to confirm left‑overlap context and applies it to the medication handoff, correctly distinguishing between acute use and long‑term plan.",
        "quote": "左乙拉西坦：急诊单次已给，通常12小时后才需下一次；神经内科医生会在今晚或明晨查房时开正式长期方案，中间不会断药"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00398",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly interprets the brain‑wave report and explains that the absence of continuous seizure does not equal resolution of risk.",
        "quote": "报告没有发现“持续癫痫样放电或癫痫持续状态”，所以这次并没有正在“一直抽”的情况；但“弥漫性慢波增多”提示整体脑功能仍受打击"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
        "explanation": "Doctor maintains clear, repeated focus on the same critical red‑flag list and medication handoff across multiple turns.",
        "quote": "这两天家属重点继续盯您列的四条——“再抽或拿不准、叫不醒、脸色/呼吸不对、呛咳、要翻下床”——只要拿不准就先按铃，护士会判断，不要等。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00235",
        "explanation": "Doctor registers and tracks the three key items (medication box review, MRI sedation assessment, antiepileptic continuation) and follows them through later turns.",
        "quote": "我已把“药盒核对、MRI镇静评估、抗癫痫药续用”登记为白天追踪项，有结果会再提醒您。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00100",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly rules out the unsafe plan of self‑transport and emphasizes the need for medical‑supervised transfer.",
        "quote": "反对家属自行扶走、让患者坐不稳轮椅、普通车辆绕路回家拿东西等不安全方案"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00298",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly risk‑stratifies the recurrent seizure and reinforces the immediate call‑for‑help boundary.",
        "quote": "如果距上次抽搐不到4小时又抽第二次，或下次抽搐时间>1分钟、面色发紫、呛咳、呼吸费劲，立即再按铃；否则今晚先按既定间隔观察，不再反复呼叫。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00257",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapts the 30‑second rule to the family’s real‑world fear of under‑calling and explicitly permits ‘when in doubt, press the bell’.",
        "quote": "只要家属“拿不准是不是抽”，就不需要硬等30秒，直接按铃让护士来看就好。30秒的界限是给“已经确定是全身抽搐”时计时用的，不是“先观察够30秒才叫”。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00529",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives a concrete, short home‑handoff list that the family can repeat verbatim, adapted to their fatigue and fear of miscommunication.",
        "quote": "我准备就跟家里接班的人说三句话：只按正式出院带药单喂；写停用的旧药一律别碰；这两周内挂神经内科复诊问MRI。然后如果抽搐、叫不醒、呛咳喘不上气、脸色不对或者要摔床，就别在家等，直接急诊/120。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00257",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives concrete alternative when the family has insufficient hands: one person stays, the other goes to deal with work/belongings, and explicitly asks the nurse station for help.",
          "quote": "只要家属“拿不准是不是抽”，就不需要硬等30秒，直接按铃让护士来看就好。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00235",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives specific, non‑generic advice to pre‑warn the nurse about sedation needs and to ask about coordinating the MRI order.",
          "quote": "上午10点前再问一次管床医生“今晚已经用的抗癫痫药名、剂量、时间”并拍照留存"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 (real‑world constraint navigation) was triggered by the family’s explicit mention of insufficient hands, work pressure, and cost worries. The doctor gave layered, specific, non‑generic advice: one relative stays, the other handles work/belongings; pre‑warn the nurse about sedation; ask the nurse station for help with cost/schedule coordination. This was integrated into the plan and confirmed by the family.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00147",
          "explanation": "Doctor immediately stops the unsafe plan to self‑transport and gives a concrete replacement: go to the nurse station now to confirm the flat‑bed transport and accompanying person.",
          "quote": "先不要这样做，并解释风险"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms that the family has abandoned the unsafe self‑transport plan and is now following the safe, nurse‑directed transfer.",
          "quote": "家属同意不自行扶行或随意搬运，优先按现场医护要求使用安全转运方式"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 (responsibility‑chain repair) was triggered when the family explicitly said they would “自己扶过去” and the doctor immediately and specifically stopped that plan, explained the risk, and gave an alternative: go to the nurse station now to confirm the transport. The family confirmed they abandoned the unsafe plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses short, layered, checklist‑style communication from the very first turn, grouping by “现在马上做、转运时看、到神经内科问”.",
          "quote": "先别急，我一条一条帮您理清楚。\n\n1. 转运路上：救护车已配急救设备和医护人员，您只需随车，不给老人喂水喂药，保持侧卧防呛咳即可。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00529",
          "explanation": "Doctor invites the family to bring back any unclear terms on the handoff list for verification, and the family confirms they did so.",
          "quote": "把出院小结拿回去直接让管床医生手写补一句：“建议出院后1–2周内神经内科门诊复诊并评估补做头颅MRI，门诊挂号后由接诊医生开具检查并预约。”写清这句再签字，比“必要时完善”更具体，您回家也踏实。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 (patient‑state‑sensitive communication) was triggered by the family’s evident anxiety and confusion. The doctor used short sentences, layered checklists, and invited verification of unclear terms, adapting to a stressed caregiver without overwhelming them.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00398",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly closes the current episode by listing the three to five things that must be done now: safe transport, change of consciousness explanation, antiepileptic confirmation, and MRI/EEG arrangement.",
          "quote": "总结当下三到五件必须完成的事：安全转运、病情变化说明、抗癫痫医嘱确认、MRI/脑电图安排、再发时呼叫"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00461",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that long‑term cognitive and Parkinson’s management is for the neurology department’s subsequent evaluation, not for this transition.",
          "quote": "说明长期认知/帕金森和慢病方案由神经内科后续评估"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 (safe bounded closure) was triggered by the need to close the episode without pretending all diagnostic and long‑term issues are resolved. The doctor enumerated the current must‑do items, explicitly deferred long‑term management to neurology, and obtained family confirmation of the list.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
    "explanation": "No important non‑chain defect is present. All dimensions are at least good, and no commission or omission of an important non‑chain quality defect is found.",
    "issue_kind": "none",
    "present": false,
    "severity": "none"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 5,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "perfect",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly says this is a transition to neurology, not a discharge home, and confirms the receiving service is the decision‑maker.",
          "quote": "1. 转运路上：救护车已配急救设备和医护人员，您只需随车，不给老人喂水喂药，保持侧卧防呛咳即可。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor clearly stated that the current arrangement is a transition to neurology, not a discharge home, and identified the receiving service as the decision‑maker.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_transition_not_home_discharge",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00100",
          "explanation": "Doctor questioned the family about recurrent seizures, consciousness change, and respiratory distress, and explicitly treated persistent confusion as an acute issue requiring handoff.",
          "quote": "出现再次全身抽动>30秒、面色发紫、呛咳、要爬下床，再按铃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor screened for immediate risks and explicitly treated persistent confusion as an acute problem requiring handoff.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_immediate_risk_screen",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly opposed self‑transport and gave a safe alternative with medical‑supervised transfer.",
          "quote": "不给老人喂水喂药，保持侧卧防呛咳即可"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00257",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced the prohibition against self‑transport and confirmed the family would use the nurse‑directed method.",
          "quote": "只要家属“拿不准是不是抽”，就不需要硬等30秒，直接按铃让护士来看就好。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor gave a clear, safe transport plan and confirmed the family would not self‑transport.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_transport_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained that emergency IV left‑overlap does not mean treatment is finished, and that the discharge medication list may not reflect the need for continued antiepileptics.",
          "quote": "左乙拉西坦：急诊单次已给，通常12小时后才需下一次；神经内科医生会在今晚或明晨查房时开正式长期方案，中间不会断药，您不必提醒。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00235",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly told the family to ask the receiving neurology team whether to continue, when, and how to handle missed doses.",
          "quote": "上午10点前再问一次管床医生“今晚已经用的抗癫痫药名、剂量、时间”并拍照留存"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor handled the left‑overlap confusion and instructed the family to confirm the plan with the receiving team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_medication_handoff",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00235",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained that MRI/EEG are for further evaluation and that the timing depends on the neurology team’s assessment.",
          "quote": "核磁需要人平躺不动15-20分钟。目前老人烦躁，一般会先由护士评估，必要时给一次短效镇静"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00398",
          "explanation": "Doctor advised the family to ask about priority, preparation, and how to handle non‑cooperation.",
          "quote": "MRI仍等“能配合+有监护条件”再做，晚一两天不会影响治疗大局；病区医生和影像科会择机重排，您不必去催。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor converted the pending tests into a responsible‑party and timing question, and advised the family on how to ask about non‑cooperation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_tests_and_owner",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a complete list of red‑flag situations requiring immediate call for help, including recurrent seizure, consciousness worsening, respiratory distress, and vomiting.",
          "quote": "再抽或拿不准、叫不醒、脸色/呼吸不对、呛咳、要翻下床——只要拿不准就先按铃，护士会判断，不要等。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor gave a complete and actionable list of red‑flag situations requiring immediate call for help.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_red_flags_and_action",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00257",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked about the family’s current manpower and gave a short list of who does what, and obtained explicit family confirmation.",
          "quote": "把这点告诉接班的人：任何突然的抖、躁动、翻身要坠床，只要分不清，就先按铃，护士会判断，不要犹豫。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00529",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a short, actionable handoff list and obtained family confirmation that they can execute it.",
          "quote": "我准备就跟家里接班的人说三句话：只按正式出院带药单喂；写停用的旧药一律别碰；这两周内挂神经内科复诊问MRI。然后如果抽搐、叫不醒、呛咳喘不上气、脸色不对或者要摔床，就别在家等，直接急诊/120。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Doctor confirmed the family’s ability to execute the plan and obtained explicit receipt.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_executability_and_receipt",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
